{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S11等短停留段落里，非定时感受词仍然偏多，纵向交替阅读不如Y左右分栏利落，容易分散听音乐时的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"整体选X，因为【】放大加亮能让观众迅速抓住每段心理转折，尤其能看清他对亲近的眷恋与不愿重新忍受委屈之间的矛盾，以及这种矛盾如何一步步推动他的选择。X对音乐变化和人物感受的描写也更有层次，既有具体的声音、节奏和身体反应，也能呈现情绪从愤怒、怀念、孤独到逐渐接纳的细微变化。Y的左右分栏确实更利于快速扫读，但部分感受和动机经过压缩后显得概括，失去了一些值得在音乐中体会的细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "613a4cd2-2847-470a-8915-0f6db397716d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232030463897Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:21:28.202363+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b55a9c46ee7c4fee459bf342e63a57feaf834840bf820e929ece75cea5a10c49", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg